  "description": "**Is it a human hand, or a beast’s paw?**\n\nAdriel Merryweather, the only son of a low-status and fading family, transfers into “St. John’s,” one of the most prestigious boarding schools, after a grueling amount of effort.\n\nWhile he enrolled to fulfill his parents’ expectations of restoring their declining household, he had an even more crucial purpose: to expose the true identity of a student at the school, Jeremiah Washburn, as a demon in the shape of a black dog.\n\n*“Long time no see. It’s good to see you.”*\n\nHowever, right on his very first day at school, Adriel has an unexpected reunion with Jeremiah—and commits a terrible mistake in front of everyone...\n\nCharacter Profiles\n\n---\n\n**Original Manhwa:**  \n[Volumes](https://ridibooks.com/books/5782000010), [Chapters](https://ridibooks.com/books/5782000012)",
